<title>PORTUGAL: J.Martins bid for Vidago result Jan 23.</title>
<headline>J.Martins bid for Vidago result Jan 23.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A special session will be held on Lisbon bourse on January 23 to announce the results of the bid by Portuguese retailer Jeronimo Martins for sparkling water company Vidago, the Lisbon bourse official bulletin said.</p>
<p>Jeronimo Martins has offered 4,300 escudos per share for Vidago, Melgaco e Pedras Salgadas, SA. The offer is conditional on the acquisition of at least 90 percent of the capital of Vidago.</p>
<p>The subscription period ends on January 20.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
